        <mxCell id="clarify" value="&lt;b&gt;M03a  Claude-requested clarification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Only when context does not settle the ambiguity&lt;br&gt;Specific alternatives + one complete question&lt;br&gt;Non-exact choice may proceed with a clear warning&lt;br&gt;User accepts / edits → M02 → M03&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#B8860B&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Schema 1,3,4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eef5ff;strokeColor=#477dac;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#203344;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;arcSize=8;" parent="1" vertex="1" schema_modules="3,4,6" tooltip="Shared immutable PanKagent pack: Schema 1 database_schema.json; 2 query_patterns.json; 3 semantic_interpretation.json; 4 validation.json. Manifest pins KG standard v0.3.0 and the release digest. Observations are descriptive, never automatic filters.">
