        <mxCell id="partialscope" value="&lt;b&gt;M04R  Planning repair exhausted&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Keep verified independent work + unmet checks&lt;br&gt;Invalidate descendants of a changed task&lt;br&gt;No exhaustive count from incomplete retrieval&lt;br&gt;No usable evidence → targeted recovery&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#B8860B&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Schema 4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eaf5ee;strokeColor=#428362;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#203344;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;arcSize=8;" parent="1" vertex="1" schema_modules="6" tooltip="Shared immutable PanKagent pack: Schema 1 database_schema.json; 2 query_patterns.json; 3 semantic_interpretation.json; 4 validation.json. Manifest pins KG standard v0.3.0 and the release digest. Observations are descriptive, never automatic filters.">
          <mxGeometry x="665" y="1970" width="500" height="215" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mode" value="&lt;b&gt;D3  Which execution mode?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Parallel / chain / mixed task DAG&lt;br&gt;CLAUDE proposes; PYTHON schedules&lt;br&gt;Verified IDs / paths bind dependent tasks&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#B8860B&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Schema 2,4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eaf5ee;strokeColor=#428362;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#203344;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;arcSize=8;" parent="1" vertex="1" decision_engine="Python (deterministic)" decision_basis="Python computes execution_mode from depends_on/path_spec and independent tasks. Claude or verified local patterns propose the plan; Python classifies it as parallel, chain or mixed." decision_source="composable_planning.py: normalize; planning_contract.py; pattern_planning.py" tooltip="Shared immutable PanKagent pack: Schema 1 database_schema.json; 2 query_patterns.json; 3 semantic_interpretation.json; 4 validation.json. Manifest pins KG standard v0.3.0 and the release digest. Observations are descriptive, never automatic filters." schema_modules="5,6">
          <mxGeometry x="1325" y="1970" width="550" height="205" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
