        <mxCell id="tK93tzaCFONGBUCUjE4C-44" value="&lt;b&gt;U • SHARED QUERY EXECUTION UNIT — used by every Q box below&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;M06 route → M07 candidate validation → M08 Neo4j execution → typed backend outcome. Same contract in all three modes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#B8860B&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Schema 1,2,4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f5f8;strokeColor=#8998a9;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#203344;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=23;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1" schema_modules="2,5,6" tooltip="Shared immutable PanKagent pack: Schema 1 database_schema.json; 2 query_patterns.json; 3 semantic_interpretation.json; 4 validation.json. Manifest pins KG standard v0.3.0 and the release digest. Observations are descriptive, never automatic filters.">
